Explanation:
Functions used: df.loc[],df.iloc[],df.set_index()
Usage: df.set_index() to set index for dataframe, df.loc and df.iloc for slicing
Interpretation: The difference arises because loc slicing is inclusive of the end label, while iloc slicing is exclusive of the end position.
